<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Totalkredit says Moody's rates bonds AA3.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Totalkredit says Moody's rates bonds AA3.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish mortgage lender Totalkredit said on Monday that its mortage-backed bonds had been rated at AA3 by Moody's.</p>
<p>&quot;Totalkredit chose to seek a rating to ensure that the sale of its bonds abroad could be carried out at competitive prices,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It follows rival Danish lenders Unikredit and Nykredit, which last year were also rated AA3, and Den Danske Bank's Dansk Kredit which has an AA2 rating.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
